	/---- VER. 8C HAS DSKIP/ADSKIP REPOSITIONED AT
	/        END OF CYCLE SUMMING
	/     VER D REFLECTS RHO-A AND MAGNITUDE CHANGES
	/      VER D/5 IS NON-TTY EDITION
	/      VER D/6 ADDED A NORHO ASSEMBLY SWITCH 
	/	TO DELETE THE CALL
	/        AND ASSEMBLY OF S/R RHO
	/	VER D/7 ADDS A MISSING FACTOR OF TEN IN THE
	/	  POLAR ROUTINE. THE 1.27324 FACTOR IS 
	/	  REMOVED FROM POLAR.
	/	  THE D.V.M. ROUTINE NOW HALTS WHEN THE SELECT
	/	  SWITCH IS CHANGED RATHER THAN GOING INTO THE
	/	  "SELECTED" ROUTINE.
	/	LOW BATTERY ROUTINE DISPLAYS "LO" IN ND2 & ND3
	/	VER D/10 ADDS FAKE TRANSMITTER CODE AND
	/	EXTENDED FREQUENCY OPTION AS A CONDITIONAL ASSEMBLY
	/		FKTX=1	ASSEMBLES DAC AS LOW POWER TX
	/		EXFQ=1	ASSEMBLES EXTENDED FREQUENCY OPTION
